ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS
----------------

SafeDepot Pro is built on the Flutter framework and the Dart SDK
(BSD 3-Clause, The Flutter Authors), Supabase for authentication, database,
row-level security, storage and edge functions, and Shorebird for over-the-air
Dart code push. See the NOTICE file for the full list.

The domain model in supabase/migrations/ was originally developed for an
earlier web implementation of SafeDepot Pro; that implementation is preserved
in the legacy/ directory of this repository.
